# dxvk-arm64-2.7.1-467-valve-proton11.tar.xz (pocknix mirror)

The DXVK donor bundle for this package: the complete `files/lib/wine/dxvk/`
directory from Valve's "Proton 11.0 (ARM64)" Steam depot, version stamp
`1779182345 proton-11.0-1-beta5-unstripped`, containing DXVK
`v2.7.1-467-g83e503b4ae6de84` (aarch64-windows arm64ec + x86_64/i386 builds).

Captured 2026-08-03 from a Steam-downloaded copy on the RP5
(`steamapps/common/Proton 11.0 (ARM64)`):

    cd ".../Proton 11.0 (ARM64)/files/lib/wine" && tar cJf dxvk-....tar.xz dxvk

sha512 pinned in the PKGBUILD. DXVK is zlib-licensed; redistribution of built
dlls is permitted. Mirrored at https://pocknix.shuuri.net/mirror/ because the
Steam depot is not URL-fetchable at build time.

Why Valve dlls and not a GE release: see the PKGBUILD header.
